**Summary:** Every single test in this file touches code paths (generating coverage) without verifying outcomes. This is the classic "assertion-free testing" anti-pattern — the suite would pass even if every method returned garbage or mutated the wrong data. The fixes above add **behavioral assertions** that would actually catch the regressions you're seeing in production.
